(146,'বেড়া মডেল থানা, পাবনা','<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">বেড়া থানার উত্তরে সিরাজগঞ্জ জেলার&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%B6%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B9%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A6%E0%A6%AA%E0%A7%81%E0%A6%B0_%E0%A6%89%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%9C%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%BE\">শাহজাদপুর থানা</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;ও&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%9A%E0%A7%8C%E0%A6%B9%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%BF_%E0%A6%89%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%9C%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%BE\">চৌহালি থানা</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">, দক্ষিণে রাজবাড়ি জেলার&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%97%E0%A7%8B%E0%A6%AF%E0%A6%BC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%A8%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%A6_%E0%A6%89%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%9C%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%BE\">গোয়ালন্দ থানা</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;এবং&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\"><a href=\"https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%B0%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%9C%E0%A6%AC%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A1%E0%A6%BC%E0%A7%80_%E0%A6%B8%E0%A6%A6%E0%A6%B0_%E0%A6%89%E0%A6%AA%E0%A6%9C%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A6%BE\">রাজবাড়ী সদর থানা</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:black\">, পূর্বে সিরাজগঞ্জের&nbsp;</span></span><